#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/github.rst:23
#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/github.rst:41
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "Consejo"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/github.rst:23
msgid ""
"We recommend using a long-lived token, Github even includes the option to"
" have no expiration on your tokens (for classic personal access tokens "
"only, not fine-grained tokens). Should the token expire, any |morpheus| "
"automation, App Blueprints, and Terraform or Kubernetes Spec Templates "
"which are based on code contained in your repositories will no longer "
"work. This could lead to failed provisioning and time spent "
"troubleshooting to isolate the issue until the Github integration is "
"refreshed with a new access token."
msgstr ""
"We recommend using un long-lived token, Github incluso includes el opción"
" to tienen no expiration on your tokens (para classic personal acceso "
"tokens solo, no fine-grained tokens). Should el token expire, cualquier "
"|morpheus| automation, App Blueprints, y Terraform o Kubernetes Spec "
"Templates cual son basado en code contained in your repositories será no "
"longer work. This podría lead to fallido provisioning y time spent "
"troubleshooting to isolate el issue hasta el Github integration es "
"refreshed con un nuevo acceso token."

