msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/github.rst:65
msgid ""
"In certain cases, it can take several seconds for the integration process"
" to complete and the ADD INTEGRATION modal to be dismissed."
msgstr ""
"In certain cases, it puede take several seconds para la integración "
"proceso to completo y el ADD INTEGRATION modal to be dismissed."

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/github.rst:68
msgid "Viewing an Integrated Github Account"
msgstr "Viewing un Integrated Github Account"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/github.rst:70
msgid ""
"When authentication is successful, click into the new Github integration "
"from the list of available integrations. The Organizations tab will list "
"each organization the Github account is associated with. The Repositories"
" tab lists all public and private repositories which are associated with "
"the account. We can also click in to each repository to view its files "
"and folders, as well as create specific types of automation or Spec "
"Templates from the files directly in this view."
msgstr ""
"When authentication es exitoso, click en el nuevo Github integration "
"desde el lista of disponible integrations. The Organizations pestaña será"
" lista cada organization el Github cuenta es asociado con. The "
"Repositories pestaña lists todos público y privado repositories cual son "
"asociado con el cuenta. We puede también click in to cada repository to "
"view its archivos y folders, así como create específico types of "
"automation o Spec Templates desde el archivos directly in este view."

